# Wave W17-AD (Amber Sea — North): shrine sand — deep-channel sand, sparse flecks: the sea-lane fleet’s darkest sand value, an olive-brown bottom lying under the narrowing channel toward Sanctum, its flecks sparse where the light thins (design: the lane narrowing toward the festival shore, the three shrine isles standing off it — their own maps, not this lane’s; the sand darkens toward them). North’s own sand — split from its twin East by light entire (darkest vs brightest in the program) and from the League sand (R223) by hue: this bottom is olive-brown channel earth, that one is slate-blue cliff shadow.
